questions.question_text:
This L-shaped carpet is to be laid in a room.
Calculate its area.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.6]
\draw[thick] (0,0)--(8,0)--(8,3)--(3,3)--(3,6)--(0,6)--cycle;
\node[below] at (4,0) {$8\text{ m}$};
\node[right] at (8,1.5) {$3\text{ m}$};
\node[above] at (5.5,3) {$5\text{ m}$};
\node[right] at (3,4.5) {$3\text{ m}$};
\node[above] at (1.5,6) {$3\text{ m}$};
\node[left] at (0,3) {$6\text{ m}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

This paved area is T-shaped.
Calculate its area.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.55]
\draw[thick] (2.5,0)--(5.5,0)--(5.5,5)--(8,5)--(8,7)--(0,7)--(0,5)--(2.5,5)--cycle;
\draw[dashed] (0,5)--(8,5);
\node[above] at (4,7) {$8\text{ m}$};
\node[left] at (0,6) {$2\text{ m}$};
\node[below] at (4,0) {$3\text{ m}$};
\node[right] at (5.5,2.5) {$5\text{ m}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
